A regular notary is not good enough… It needs to specifically be a medallion signature and it needs to include both my signature and another persons signature with the medallion signature guarantee. I and this other person work during the day. Generally from 8-5 or 6 pm during the week. The medallion signature places I’ve found are bank branches open 9am to 4pm only on Monday-Friday. So coordinating two people’s schedule who don’t live or work near each other and can go Monday-Friday into a bank branch from 9am -4pm is a hassle. 

Is it doable? Sure! Is it easy to make work. Definitely not.

